Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:36.12,Shape,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(60,1368)\1c&H242120&\bord0\shad0\fad(120,120)\p1}m 0 0 l 783 0 l 783 60 l 0 60{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.02,0:05:36.12,Name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,1298)\fad(120,120)}Dr Kieran Mullan MP
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.02,0:05:36.12,Party,,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,1376)\fad(120,120)}Conservative · Bexhill and Battle
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}The report should\Nbe more widely read,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.20,0:05:33.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}and I often wonder\Nwhy it did not
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.60,0:05:34.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}get the attention\Nthat it deserved.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.78,0:05:38.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}It found that between\N1987 and 2001,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:38.04,0:05:41.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}more than 450 NHS\Npatients had their lives
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.50,0:05:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}prematurely shortened\Nby healthcare staff.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}They were mainly\Nelderly—the average age
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}being 81—but some\Nwere as young as 61,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.26,0:05:50.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}and more than 70% of\Nthem had been admitted
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}to hospital not needing\Npalliative care or
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1600)}being at the end\Nof their lives.
